{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dee96d0d8f3e13696c7472efe063a427253a9eec95b3a4f8f73194f862109a32", "ja": "（風花の新曲のPV撮影は滞りなく終了！\nその後のインタビューも、自信をもって答えていた）", "zh": "（风花的新歌PV拍摄顺利结束！之后的采访，她也充满自信地回答了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3a1fbc69f423ce6f57eeef26fc026ecfaa4ce8cd7f1503b48f1e8d1937cfbf44", "ja": "風花、お疲れさま。\n今日の撮影、気合いが入ってたな。", "zh": "风花，辛苦了。今天的拍摄，你还真是干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ccaf5beb3131bfae2c905c8f13a66ff9b6ddf2dc922f251fd657c1f4e15293e3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nふふっ、そうですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n呵呵，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8125a2c0b149d783ce306dd30df3ad61f522480cf48aa41d6014970a992a2ca2", "ja": "ひとりでも多くの人にあの曲……\n『祈りの羽根』を聞いてもらえたらって。", "zh": "希望能让更多的人听到那首歌……\n《祈祷之羽》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d1c14340decf7720b02eed46471e0c8e6a1e4d26e1110c139d0f01a702269afe", "ja": "そう思ったら、やる気が溢れてきて……\nあっ。いつもやる気がないってわけじゃないですよ？", "zh": "一想到这里，就干劲十足起来了……\n啊，我平时也不是没有干劲哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c623e8ef52f4c1bc282ffca5ea8c87851b34be22a3c0348274659590b5efad80", "ja": "大丈夫、わかってるよ！　そうか、だから\nインタビューの回答も熱が入ってたんだな。", "zh": "没关系，我懂的！原来如此，怪不得\n接受采访时的回答也那么充满热情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "83399e4ba055c273f53e9d117357624ad9a7aed2b3ed1bd10eeb58a92ba5faee", "ja": "あれは……インタビューの内容に、\n学生さんへのメッセージがありましたよね？", "zh": "那个是……采访内容里，有给学生们的寄语，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1e145215e26be4b82cc6ed06d029e8905970b05a1ea094b353c6d2de9cfcae1a", "ja": "その時、ふと自分の学生時代を思い出しちゃって。", "zh": "那时，我不由得想起了自己的学生时代。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1008_p", "source_sha256": "903f7ef0b5a1f6109986dff2108236448f73ef235778804ea42348173d4c27a9", "ja": "学生時代か。風花は、どんな学生だったんだ？", "zh": "学生时代啊。风花以前是个什么样的学生呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2d8446ba4d7b2fd1f4fc15b6b9e10821680344137688c190f4f70dfeb787321", "ja": "私は……普通でしたよ。勉強して、友達と遊んで。\nいろんな将来を想像して、たくさん悩んで……。", "zh": "我……很普通。学习，和朋友一起玩。\n想象过各种各样的未来，也烦恼过很多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c7943350f7d6dbbea3b218d56030c4891b7b90246f81437010530e1e5b55a30", "ja": "当時は、アイドルに憧れはありましたけど、\n自分がなるなんて想像もしてませんでした。", "zh": "那时候虽然对偶像心怀向往，\n但我从来没想过自己会成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8c4ed98e03654473106bc35e72dc023ef751504596890de0e329058f19f4b949", "ja": "そうか。でも、きっと風花の事だから。\nひたむきに頑張っていたんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊。不过，毕竟是风花嘛。你一定也一直在一心一意地努力吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7e66b895dfeb5d8f96fea1e758a20edeef40396fb84fbe965fea34328ec07ef6", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。楽しいことも多かったけど……\n進路を考えていた時は、少し苦しかったかな。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。虽然开心的事情也很多，不过……考虑未来该走什么路的时候，还是有些辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ca1b54d67e56bf9535410532db2af4a420f12a94daae3b1c52451d005c4badb8", "ja": "どうしていいかわからなくて、もどかしくて……\nあの頃の私みたいに、悩んでいる人がいるのかもって。", "zh": "因为不知道该怎么办，实在让人很焦急……\n说不定，也有人像那时候的我一样，正烦恼着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9347391f12baf31f82f1ae9ca241931a817b2fdc194c6c2d5a89527986a66e33", "ja": "だからこの曲を通して、知ってもらいたいんです。\n「あなたのことを見てる人が、必ずいるよ」って。", "zh": "所以我想通过这首歌，让大家知道：\n“无论如何，一定有人在关注着你。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "af4fe2bccf6c7fd53c1d5f69de44bba4a38a4f14d83d164f27b1c20c9a126dbc", "ja": "自分に無理をしなくてもいいんだ、ってこと……\nそう思うだけでも、心が軽くなると思うから。", "zh": "不用勉强自己也没关系……\n哪怕只是这么想想，我觉得心情也会轻松一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9256d5a38f1814005726e4bbfa98f56f8cd2890716bd8ae9c476fa60d042ac93", "ja": "そういう思いを込めて、歌ってくれてたんだな。\n大丈夫。風花の思いは必ず伝わるよ。", "zh": "原来你是怀着这样的心情在歌唱啊。\n没事的，风花的心意一定能传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "77743595ae7e9624df45167795c7b07c9af94e576b4032bc32b1b1947c6f0dd3", "ja": "……なあ、風花。", "zh": "……我说，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c79fc3ccbe16715645da01170395a85a624f08083f50d1a8b188c7318c778111", "ja": "はい？\nなんですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "嗯？\n怎么了，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1019_p", "source_sha256": "42944c4bc877267b060793ac3116fe1ef5e6cb54988eb3c68c45003d023a22f6", "ja": "風花の頑張りは、俺がちゃんと見てるから。\nだから……風花もなにかあれば、頼ってくれよ。", "zh": "风花的努力，我一直都认真看在眼里。\n所以……风花要是有什么事，也尽管来找我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ff16caf0b7bd3dab5b87802f2241a36b66fb8f6345b2b1cf89a121d870fac90d", "ja": "……っ！　ずるいです、{$P$}さん。\nそんな風に言われたら、私……。", "zh": "……！太犯规了，{$P$}先生。您这么说的话，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "49300ee2c880d6de7804617ca283c7cda975888c6593aef4678995afd92ce2bb", "ja": "もっともっと、頑張りたくなっちゃうじゃないですか！\nせっかく、頑張りすぎないでって歌ってるのに！", "zh": "这样一来，不就让我想更加努力、更加努力了吗！\n明明我还在唱着“不要太拼命”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c30c5ac89cdf09fa5fa8678a8fc2c3c6cd661bc3789eabaed3690f4aee3c6f03", "ja": "え？　あ、ごめん。\n別にそういうつもりで言ったわけじゃ……。", "zh": "诶？啊，对不起。\n我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0aeeb525bba3417f3affb41d586f1f8ee50a9de94dbe000f478a78fafaee73ae", "ja": "{$P$}さんにそういうつもりが\nないのはわかってます！　……もう、ズルいんだから。", "zh": "我知道{$P$}先生不是那个意思！……真是的，太狡猾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2a984a5aecb8da2f55e374e9404d3b9d133af9ab70d0dfe8a92e1a8063a2afdc", "ja": "でも、私がお仕事を頑張ろうって思ったのは本当なので\n……これから、覚悟してくださいね♪", "zh": "但是，我是真的下定决心要努力工作的……\n所以，接下来请做好觉悟哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0374_1025_p", "source_sha256": "52481fe1d736b148004325b8c7c89d009fa51ca4ad787e2a244844536689581f", "ja": "（風花の思いは、歌を通して多くの人に届くだろう。\n疲れた人々の心を癒やす祈りとなって……）", "zh": "（风花的心意，一定会通过歌声传达给许多人吧。化作治愈疲惫人们心灵的祈祷……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
